Title: Downstream Consumer Fixture for zuxml
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not for release. Consumes the zuxml C API exactly as zuhttp will,
    through Imports plus LinkingTo and the registered function table, so that
    an unusable public header is discovered here rather than downstream.
